This package follows the dgit-maint-debrebase(7) workflow.

The package also follows DEP-14, so you'll find what you'd expect in the
debian/latest and upstream/latest branches.

New upstream releases are fetched from the upstream git repository from
the "upstreamvcs" remote. Unfortunately, filtering of files listed in
debian/copyright's Files-Excluded field has to be performed manually.

As upstream does not use tarballs, a pristine-tar branch is not
maintained.

Lastly, uploads are performed using git-debpush(1).

 -- Andrea Pappacoda <tachi@debian.org>  Mon, 02 Jun 2025 18:19:03 +0200
